
txt delete group 1008
txt delete compute

txt push
txt fill off
txt group 1008
txt left
txt font 3
txt 10 10 d     % text `d' will be overwritten by dowker code
txt set dowker  % sets the text of the last defined txt object to the current dowker code
txt xing on

show orient

txt clobber on
txt centre
txt font 4
txt fill on
%txt c 60 "compute" "txt delete compute;txt fill off;txt push;txt group 1008;txt hack;txt pop"



txt fill off

txt pop
